    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:</i>&nbsp;<i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p><b>Manufactured By:</b> The <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Iridonian\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Iridonian\">Iridonians</a> (<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species\" title=\"Species\">Species</a>) </p><p><b>Applicable To:</b> Any Armor, Any Weapon </p><p>The <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Iridonian\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Iridonian\">Iridonians</a> are a mysterious <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species\" title=\"Species\">Species</a> known for their savagery and aggressiveness. </p><p><b>Weapons:</b> Iridonian Manufacture Weapons gain a +2 bonus <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to damage rolls when using either the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Attack\" title=\"Power Attack\">Power Attack</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Blast\" title=\"Power Blast\">Power Blast</a> Feats. However, all Iridonian Manufacture Weapons are considered <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Illegal\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Illegal\">Illegal</a>, and visibly displaying an Iridonian Manufacture Weapon always imposes unfavorable circumstances on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> checks against law enforcement officers and other authority figures. </p><p><b>Armors:</b> Iridonian Manufacture Armors and Shields provide <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">Damage Reduction</a> 2 against Bludgeoning damage. However, all Iridonian Manufacture Armors are considered <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Illegal\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Illegal\">Illegal</a>, and wearing Iridonian Manufacture Armor always imposes unfavorable circumstances on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> checks against law enforcement officers and other authority figures. </p>",
